# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own RPC URLs. .env is in .gitignore, so it never gets committed.
#
# The fork tests in test/ run against the live Portal and need one RPC URL per chain. A test is skipped when its
# variable is not set.
#
# USE YOUR OWN NODE OR A PROVIDER KEY. A fork test makes thousands of state reads (every storage slot the launch,
# the pool and the trades touch), and the free public nodes rate limit and prune old state. With them a full run is
# slow and can fail in the middle of a test for reasons that have nothing to do with your contracts. A key from any
# BNB Chain provider (Alchemy, QuickNode, Ankr, NodeReal, ...) or your own node avoids that.
#
# The two public endpoints are fine to try one test:
#   BNB Chain   https://bsc-dataseed.bnbchain.org
#   BNB Testnet https://bsc-testnet-dataseed.bnbchain.org

# BNB Chain (chain id 56)
BSC_RPC_URL=

# BNB Testnet (chain id 97)
BSC_TESTNET_RPC_URL=
